 ## Testing and Validation
 To ensure robust implementation, clients and relays should validate **₿Muse** events using the following:

 ### Test Vectors
 - **Valid Free Event**:
   ```json
   {
     "kind": 1001,
     "pubkey": "53a6e8f1b8b53f7d92e4a8b9f1a4b6f8c6e4b8f9a4b6f8c6e4b8f9a4b6f8c6e",
     "created_at": 1739318400,
     "tags": [
       ["title", "Test Song"],
       ["artist", "Test Artist"],
       ["file", "https://nostr.build/audio/test.mp3"],
       ["license", "CC-BY-SA"],
       ["client", "BMuse"]
     ],
     "content": "Free test song!",
     "id": "<computed>",
     "sig": "<signature>"
   }
   ```
   - **Expected Behavior**: Clients display metadata and stream `file` URL without payment.

 - **Valid Paywalled Event**:
   ```json
   {
     "kind": 1001,
     "pubkey": "53a6e8f1b8b53f7d92e4a8b9f1a4b6f8c6e4b8f9a4b6f8c6e4b8f9a4b6f8c6e",
     "created_at": 1739318400,
     "tags": [
       ["title", "Premium Song"],
       ["artist", "Test Artist"],
       ["file", "https://nostr.build/audio/premium.mp3"],
       ["license", "All Rights Reserved"],
       ["lightning", "lnurl1dp68gurn8ghj7..."],
       ["price", "1000"],
       ["client", "BMuse"]
     ],
     "content": "Pay 1000 sats to listen!",
     "id": "<computed>",
     "sig": "<signature>"
   }
   ```
   - **Expected Behavior**: Clients prompt for 1000 satoshis payment via LNURL before granting `file` access.

 - **Invalid Event (Missing Required Tag)**:
   ```json
   {
     "kind": 1001,
     "pubkey": "53a6e8f1b8b53f7d92e4a8b9f1a4b6f8c6e4b8f9a4b6f8c6e4b8f9a4b6f8c6e",
     "created_at": 1739318400,
     "tags": [
       ["artist", "Test Artist"],
       ["file", "https://nostr.build/audio/invalid.mp3"],
       ["license", "CC-BY-SA"]
     ],
     "content": "Missing title!",
     "id": "<computed>",
     "sig": "<signature>"
   }
   ```
   - **Expected Behavior**: Clients reject the event due to missing `title` tag.

 ### Testing Checklist
 - **Event Validation**:
   - Confirm required tags (`title`, `artist`, `file`, `license`) are present.
   - Validate `lightning` tag as a valid LNURL per [NIP-21](https://github.com/nostr-protocol/nips/blob/master/21.md).
   - Validate `bitcoin` tag as a BIP-173 address.
   - Verify `price` is a positive integer (in satoshis).
 - **Payment Verification**:
   - Test Lightning payments with mock LNURL responses.
   - Test Bitcoin payments with mock TXIDs via [Mempool.space](https://mempool.space/) API.
   - Ensure rate-limiting (e.g., 10 requests/minute) on verification endpoints.
 - **Media Access**:
   - Stream free content without payment.
   - Block paywalled content until payment is confirmed.
 - **Client Rendering**:
   - Display metadata and license in clients like [Damus](https://damus.io/) or [Primal](https://primal.net/).
   - Test fallback to `content` as a text note for non-supporting clients.

