 ## Interoperability
 - **Nostr Clients**: Render as music posts (e.g., [Primal](https://primal.net/), [Damus](https://damus.io/)). Encourage showcasing **₿Muse** events in these clients.
 - **External Platforms**: Cross-post via [Bridgey Fed](https://bridgey.fed/).
 - **Music Platforms**: Align with [Wavlake](https://wavlake.com/) metadata, avoiding `kind: 32123` conflicts. Collaboration with Wavlake is recommended to integrate NIP-102 natively.

